<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<roster id="2i0cc5" name="nh-001-all-units" battleScribeVersion="2.03" generatedBy="https://newrecruit.eu" gameSystemId="e51d-b1a3-75fc-dc3g" gameSystemName="Age of Sigmar 4.0" gameSystemRevision="98" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/rosterSchema"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="5340" /></costs><costLimits><costLimit name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costLimits><forces><force id="2sd0iqo" name="✦ General's Handbook 2026-27" entryId="0151-9c5b-2f1e-32d4" catalogueId="640e-6bc1-c83d-13c" catalogueRevision="43" catalogueName="Nighthaunt"><selections><selection id="blq2hs" name="Allow Legends" entryId="7e59-2237-4890-a80a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" entryId="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" name="Configuration" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="bp1v2qj" name="Battle Traits: Nighthaunt" entryId="619f-b41c-341a-dbff::53c5-1078-24f5-3301" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="ca03-ec11-f370-b66d" name="Ethereal" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Ignore negative modifiers to save rolls for friendly **^^Nighthaunt^^** units, excluding **Nagash**.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Green</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="c6d2-2b92-5367-7b43" name="Ethereal Translocation" hidden="false" typeId="55ac-f837-dded-5872" typeName="Ability (Command)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="736-6e3a-d0b5-a1b0">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Cost" typeId="a49e-3082-e2a6-e802">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="b77f-7548-840e-c086">Pick a friendly **^^Nighthaunt^^** unit that is not in combat to use this ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="2111-3ca8-61dd-a5f0">Remove that unit from the battlefield and set it up again on the battlefield more than 9&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="445d-f443-5448-e7ce"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5c69-e4b9-19bc-e801">Grey</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="2bd5-08f1-f3d1-86f7">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="df75-e7dc-12b5-48a8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="fc5b-13e9-6116-364b" name="Mounting Dread" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Subtract the current battle round number from the control scores of enemy units while they are in combat with any friendly **^^Nighthaunt^^** units.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Control</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="67e0-33db-1c0a-6797" name="Sepulchral Apparitions" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), Deployment Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If there is a friendly **Nexus of Grief** on the battlefield, you can set up up to 2 additional **Nexuses of Grief** on the battlefield. Each must be set up wholly outside enemy territory, more than 3&quot; from all objectives and other terrain features, and more than 12&quot; from all other friendly **Nexuses of Grief**.
**Designer's Note:** *The original* **Nexus of Grief** *is set up in Step 1 of the deployment phase using the 'Deploy Faction Terrain' ability. This ability allows you to set up a second and third such terrain feature and is used in Step 3 of the deployment phase, after armies have been deployed.*</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile></profiles><categories><category id="3360-1158-e879-9606" entryId="3360-1158-e879-9606" name="Reference" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="3wqs69" name="Battle Formation" entryId="f74e-3db3-975c-e98" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="bthe1dr" name="Battle Formation" entryId="f74e-3db3-975c-e98" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="3yhxj3m" name="Battle Tactic Cards" entryId="1668-6989-2470-5e10" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="bzxg9r" name="Battle Tactic Cards" entryId="1668-6989-2470-5e10" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="40m5ee" name="Manifestation Lore" entryId="9ca4-8ba8-e070-e6b3" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="c5423af" name="Manifestation Lore" entryId="9ca4-8ba8-e070-e6b3" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="42cy9dt" name="Spell Lore" entryId="ad79-2f3c-9663-3244" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><selections><selection id="43ccsmc" name="Lore of the Underworlds" entryId="62d8-72ee-f02a-27d::8c60-eedf-17ff-8fc8" entryGroupId="62d8-72ee-f02a-27d::2d44-c570-16a4-b2b5" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Spell Lores"><selections><selection id="44dylm8" name="Chains of Death" entryId="62d8-72ee-f02a-27d::0cde-b44b-11da-0c51::286c-2a5a-a56b-b591" entryGroupId="62d8-72ee-f02a-27d::0cde-b44b-11da-0c51::2fe9-d861-ccdf-9560" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of the Underworlds"><profiles><profile id="5b6a-4854-9dab-aca2" name="Chains of Death" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Nighthaunt Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy **^^Hero^^** unit within 18&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">The target has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Defensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="43zqnw" name="Fell Blades" entryId="62d8-72ee-f02a-27d::0cde-b44b-11da-0c51::c387-e55e-f7aa-2de1" entryGroupId="62d8-72ee-f02a-27d::0cde-b44b-11da-0c51::2fe9-d861-ccdf-9560" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of the Underworlds"><profiles><profile id="304-da2-5490-bc0d" name="Fell Blades" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Nighthaunt Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible friendly **^^Nighthaunt^^** unit  wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, each time the target uses a **^^Fight^^** ability, if all of its attacks targeted the same enemy unit, after that ability has been resolved, subtract 1 from save rolls for that enemy unit for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**, **^^Unlimited^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="433zbi9" name="Wrench Souls" entryId="62d8-72ee-f02a-27d::0cde-b44b-11da-0c51::d3bf-b874-35cc-6cd8" entryGroupId="62d8-72ee-f02a-27d::0cde-b44b-11da-0c51::2fe9-d861-ccdf-9560" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of the Underworlds"><profiles><profile id="d1e3-4be0-e6ae-c935" name="Wrench Souls" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Nighthaunt Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible friendly non-**^^Hero Nighthaunt Infantry^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">The target can immediately use the 'Normal Move' or 'Retreat' ability as if it were your movement phase.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Movement</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="cg74b9" name="Spell Lore" entryId="ad79-2f3c-9663-3244" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><selections><selection id="chfcx2" name="Lore of the Underworlds" entryId="62d8-72ee-f02a-27d::8c60-eedf-17ff-8fc8" entryGroupId="62d8-72ee-f02a-27d::2d44-c570-16a4-b2b5" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Spell Lores"><selections><selection id="ciqjs" name="Chains of Death" entryId="62d8-72ee-f02a-27d::0cde-b44b-11da-0c51::286c-2a5a-a56b-b591" entryGroupId="62d8-72ee-f02a-27d::0cde-b44b-11da-0c51::2fe9-d861-ccdf-9560" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of the Underworlds"><profiles><profile id="5b6a-4854-9dab-aca2" name="Chains of Death" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Nighthaunt Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy **^^Hero^^** unit within 18&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">The target has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Defensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="chyd0cg" name="Fell Blades" entryId="62d8-72ee-f02a-27d::0cde-b44b-11da-0c51::c387-e55e-f7aa-2de1" entryGroupId="62d8-72ee-f02a-27d::0cde-b44b-11da-0c51::2fe9-d861-ccdf-9560" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of the Underworlds"><profiles><profile id="304-da2-5490-bc0d" name="Fell Blades" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Nighthaunt Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible friendly **^^Nighthaunt^^** unit  wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, each time the target uses a **^^Fight^^** ability, if all of its attacks targeted the same enemy unit, after that ability has been resolved, subtract 1 from save rolls for that enemy unit for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**, **^^Unlimited^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="cid8w7" name="Wrench Souls" entryId="62d8-72ee-f02a-27d::0cde-b44b-11da-0c51::d3bf-b874-35cc-6cd8" entryGroupId="62d8-72ee-f02a-27d::0cde-b44b-11da-0c51::2fe9-d861-ccdf-9560" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of the Underworlds"><profiles><profile id="d1e3-4be0-e6ae-c935" name="Wrench Souls" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Nighthaunt Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible friendly non-**^^Hero Nighthaunt Infantry^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">The target can immediately use the 'Normal Move' or 'Retreat' ability as if it were your movement phase.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Movement</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="45tmylx" name="Nexus of Grief" entryId="1475-38bb-e6a9-5fb1::ca5e-5353-81bc-4e13" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><rules><rule id="2fb0-b403-50b2-cdd3" name="Nexus of Grief" hidden="false"><description>**The following universal terrain abilities apply to this terrain feature (Terrain, 1.2):
Cover, Impassable**</description></rule></rules><profiles><profile id="70dc-1068-35f2-0262" name="Nexus of Grief" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="4b77-1a79-0b84-2646" name="Awful Refashioning" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **Nexus of Grief**, then pick up to 3 friendly **^^Nighthaunt^^** units wholly within 12&quot; of it to be the targets. You cannot pick the same unit to be a target of this ability more than once per phase.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For each target:
• If the target is damaged, **Heal (D3)** the target.
• If the target is not damaged, return a number of slain models to it with a combined Health characteristic of up to D3.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="391a-f304-cc8f-56b0" name="Screams of the Penitent" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Enemy units cannot use commands while they are within 3&quot; of this terrain feature.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="53a0-0c1a-5694-33a3" name="Hungry Crypts" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Remove this terrain feature from the battlefield and set it up again on the battlefield within 3&quot; of a friendly **^^Nighthaunt^^** unit, more than 3&quot; from all objectives and enemy units, more than 1&quot; from all terrain features and more than 12&quot; from all other friendly **Nexuses of Grief**.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><categories><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false" /><category id="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" entryId="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" name="FACTION TERRAIN" primary="true" /><category id="e3a4-4581-9f76-4215" name="NIGHTHAUNT" entryId="e3a4-4581-9f76-4215" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="cnxwbhs" name="Nexus of Grief" entryId="1475-38bb-e6a9-5fb1::ca5e-5353-81bc-4e13" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><rules><rule id="2fb0-b403-50b2-cdd3" name="Nexus of Grief" hidden="false"><description>**The following universal terrain abilities apply to this terrain feature (Terrain, 1.2):
Cover, Impassable**</description></rule></rules><profiles><profile id="70dc-1068-35f2-0262" name="Nexus of Grief" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="4b77-1a79-0b84-2646" name="Awful Refashioning" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **Nexus of Grief**, then pick up to 3 friendly **^^Nighthaunt^^** units wholly within 12&quot; of it to be the targets. You cannot pick the same unit to be a target of this ability more than once per phase.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For each target:
• If the target is damaged, **Heal (D3)** the target.
• If the target is not damaged, return a number of slain models to it with a combined Health characteristic of up to D3.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="391a-f304-cc8f-56b0" name="Screams of the Penitent" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Enemy units cannot use commands while they are within 3&quot; of this terrain feature.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="53a0-0c1a-5694-33a3" name="Hungry Crypts" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Remove this terrain feature from the battlefield and set it up again on the battlefield within 3&quot; of a friendly **^^Nighthaunt^^** unit, more than 3&quot; from all objectives and enemy units, more than 1&quot; from all terrain features and more than 12&quot; from all other friendly **Nexuses of Grief**.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><categories><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false" /><category id="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" entryId="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" name="FACTION TERRAIN" primary="true" /><category id="e3a4-4581-9f76-4215" name="NIGHTHAUNT" entryId="e3a4-4581-9f76-4215" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /></categories></selection></selections><costs><cost name="Force Category - GHB" typeId="de92-2099-fbf7-a156" value="1" /></costs><categories><category name="Configuration" id="vkppuj" primary="false" entryId="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" /><category name="Reference" id="vky9e6a" primary="false" entryId="3360-1158-e879-9606" /><category name="Army Composition" id="2yslwib" primary="false" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" /><category name="FACTION TERRAIN" id="2y63u8l" primary="false" entryId="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" /><category name="Illegal Units" id="s3d3nq8" primary="false" entryId="(Illegal Units)" /></categories><forces><force id="rdpanlp" name="Auxillary Units" entryId="6084-3baa-f00b-ac0a::8732-47c4-9f1c-e71e" catalogueId="640e-6bc1-c83d-13c" catalogueRevision="43" catalogueName="Nighthaunt"><selections><selection id="cr4xtb" name="Awlrach the Drowner" entryId="e5fd-27bc-4ac3-4825::d8ef-7494-db04-b1a9" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="9553-e4ac-8c8a-cc6a" name="Awlrach the Drowner" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="d455-67e0-aa4e-ad3a" name="Drifting on Spectral Tides" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, this unit can immediately use the 'Normal Move' or the 'Retreat' ability as if it were your movement phase.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="859a-f549-5b04-032d" name="Passage Through the Underworlds" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle, Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit is not in combat, pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Nighthaunt^^** unit that is not in combat and is wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Remove this unit and the target from the battlefield, then set them up again on the battlefield wholly within 6&quot; of each other and more than 7&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="csszi5q" name="Awlrach the Drowner" entryId="e5fd-27bc-4ac3-4825::b6df-5610-c764-3f1c" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="ctqrm2" name="Deathwood Oar" entryId="e5fd-27bc-4ac3-4825::5149-8461-85f8-841a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="61d-8bc3-32a2-4720" name="Deathwood Oar" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Auto-wound)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="110" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" name="FLY" entryId="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" primary="false" /><category id="e3a4-4581-9f76-4215" name="NIGHTHAUNT" entryId="e3a4-4581-9f76-4215" primary="false" /><category id="f7bc-b618-4b5d-2bae" name="WAR MACHINE" entryId="f7bc-b618-4b5d-2bae" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="a21saz" name="Cairn Wraith" entryId="7648-12f1-95fd-fcd2::eac-95c-b449-a7a5" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="1b2b-ac1a-8ba-89aa" name="Cairn Wraith" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">8&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="aacb-5601-8d3f-91df" name="Eager Death-Dealers" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible friendly **Grimghast Reapers** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Add 1 to wound rolls for the target's combat attacks for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="a3zc2q" name="Cairn Wraith" entryId="7648-12f1-95fd-fcd2::170d-a97-a675-8775" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="a74bpi" name="Cairnoch Scythe" entryId="7648-12f1-95fd-fcd2::7b14-277a-9c3b-7979" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="d25b-a6e3-6611-6d46" name="Cairnoch Scythe" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Auto-wound)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="130" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false" /><category id="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" name="FLY" entryId="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" primary="false" /><category id="e3a4-4581-9f76-4215" name="NIGHTHAUNT" entryId="e3a4-4581-9f76-4215" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" name="Legends" entryId="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="cy7k22" name="Guardian of Souls" entryId="5672-e1eb-f03c-a494::76b8-eb95-f916-c5b5" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="7750-21f-513e-1e3d" name="Guardian of Souls" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">8&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="9325-4f4a-2b34-573c" name="Nightmare Lantern" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible friendly **^^Nighthaunt^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, add 1 to wound rolls for the target's attacks for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="czrb0rj" name="Guardian of Souls" entryId="5672-e1eb-f03c-a494::b813-5b3e-2749-b5fb" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="d3rw12w" name="Chill Blade" entryId="5672-e1eb-f03c-a494::279a-bcc0-f802-4397" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="1da0-34d5-d7ce-b7e8" name="Chill Blade" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Auto-wound)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="100" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false" /><category id="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" name="FLY" entryId="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" primary="false" /><category id="e3a4-4581-9f76-4215" name="NIGHTHAUNT" entryId="e3a4-4581-9f76-4215" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="dbb2gmc" name="Knight of Shrouds" entryId="cb94-2d3c-b866-f621::625-d4af-9738-48ca" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="8dfc-2dbe-680e-6d21" name="Knight of Shrouds" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">8&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="95a7-816e-af01-723" name="Stolen Hours" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time this unit uses a **^^Fight^^** ability, after that **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved, **Heal (X)** this unit, where X is the number of damage points allocated to enemy units by combat attacks made as part of that **^^Fight^^** ability.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Green</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8ed9-aa42-dcb2-eeda" name="Infantry Overseer" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: You declared a **^^Fight^^** ability for this unit</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick a friendly non**^^-Hero Nighthaunt Infantry^^** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved. If it is picked to do so, add 1 to hit rolls for the target's attacks for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes>